WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------

This license applies to the original content of this repository: the wiki pages under
`content/`, the generated indexes and maps, the site configuration, and the
documentation at the repository root.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit, link to this license, indicate if changes were
made, and distribute your contributions under the same license.

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
------------------------

The pages here summarize, analyze and cite third-party work: papers, lecture slides,
book chapters, articles and documentation. Those source documents are NOT part of this
repository and are not published; they are held privately and remain under the rights
of their respective owners.

Summaries and analysis are original text and are covered by this license. Quoted
excerpts remain the property of their authors and are reproduced briefly, with
attribution, for commentary and criticism. Every source summary records its author,
title, and canonical URL; `content/NOTICE.md` lists all of them.

A NOTE ON AUTHORSHIP
--------------------

Every page in this repository was written by a language model under human direction.
`content/trust.md` states what has been checked mechanically, what has not been checked
by a human, and what that checking does not establish.
